  "body": "IGNORE THE CV - VENDOR IS ON THE MOVE AND MOTIVATED TO SELL!\r\n\r\nSome homes just have that something special. A little nostalgia, a whole lot of personality, and a position that's getting harder and harder to find.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 15 Carlisle Road. A seriously cool 1950s Kiwi classic sitting proudly on an incredible 1,017sqm freehold site, with sweeping, elevated sea views across Browns Bay and out towards Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nClassic weatherboard charm, beautiful timber floors, original features and a wonderfully retro feel you simply can't recreate in a new build. It's authentic, full of character and has a vibe all of its own.\r\n\r\nComfortable single-level living means you can move straight in and enjoy it as it stands, or bring your imagination and give this much-loved classic its next chapter.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the land! A rare quarter-acre freehold section with room to spread out, entertain, create something special or explore its longer-term potential, subject to the necessary approvals. Just imagine an expansive deck making the most of those incredible views!\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n\r\n*  Classic 1950's weatherboard home with concrete tile roof\r\n*  Rare 1,017sqm freehold section (more or less)\r\n*  Spectacular elevated sea views towards Rangitoto Island\r\n*  Polished timber floors and charming original features\r\n*  Easy single-level living and separate single garage\r\n*  Separate internal laundry \r\n*  3 Spacious bedrooms, plus a study\r\n*  Garage, plus off-street parking \r\n*  Generous grounds with exciting future possibilities\r\n*  Moments from Browns Bay Beach, cafes, shops and restaurants\r\n\r\nOur seller is heading South, and this character-filled coastal classic is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nCome for the views. Stay for the vibe. Fall in love with the possibilities.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 5 November 2026 from 5pm at Ray White Milford (unless sold prior)\r\nINFO: https://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG36029 (scroll down to documents)",
